    "detailed_description": "<h1>MAKE SURE TO WISHLIST DEATHGROUND!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/ed4b869f94f3a33728d2f9d77ee0c8f7.poster.avif?t=1750786116\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/ed4b869f94f3a33728d2f9d77ee0c8f7.webm?t=1750786116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/ed4b869f94f3a33728d2f9d77ee0c8f7.mp4?t=1750786116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Add Deathground to your wishlist!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The best thing you can do to support us is wishlist the game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Help boost the game's visibility on Steam with just a click, it'll also ensure that you get notified as soon as we release. We appreciate your support!</p></p><br><h1>GET EARLY DEVELOPMENT UPDATES ON DISCORD</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/d1e78fe70a1c63583aeb3b309cb5d2e2.avif?t=1750786116\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Join our Discord Server</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get regular sneak peeks and behind-the-scenes of Deathground's development, chat with our community and feedback on the game. You never know, you might find your future squad mates there.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter the Deathground, a terrifying survival horror experience where you\u2019re hunted by reactive, relentless dinosaurs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play solo or team up with up to 3 others as you infiltrate abandoned facilities, now overrun and crawling with danger, to complete high-risk objectives. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KEY FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Scary and Blood-Thirsty Dinosaurs</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face off against relentless predators that hunt using sight, sound and movement, forcing you to adapt your strategy in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/c621db389bcefd142afc9914e90d705c.poster.avif?t=1750786116\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/c621db389bcefd142afc9914e90d705c.webm?t=1750786116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/c621db389bcefd142afc9914e90d705c.mp4?t=1750786116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Thrilling Gameplay, Built for Replayability</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each mission in Deathground is a tense encounter where every decision matters. Procedurally generated elements, dynamic objectives and reactive enemy AI create a fresh, high-stakes challenge with every playthrough. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use stealth, combat, teamwork and a range of specialist tools to adapt, outsmart your predators and make it to extraction. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/454508f0009831496dc1f1d89280f00f.poster.avif?t=1750786116\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/454508f0009831496dc1f1d89280f00f.webm?t=1750786116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/454508f0009831496dc1f1d89280f00f.mp4?t=1750786116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Squad-based survival horror</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Coordinate with up to 3 other players and manage specialist items such as the Motion Detector, Tranquilizer Rifle, Hacking Device or Medkit, each offering unique tactical advantages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With deadly threats lurking in every shadow, teamwork and cooperation can mean the difference between extraction and extinction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/eb3d6f2bdfcc36e0c3943cd56500f6a2.poster.avif?t=1750786116\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/eb3d6f2bdfcc36e0c3943cd56500f6a2.webm?t=1750786116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/eb3d6f2bdfcc36e0c3943cd56500f6a2.mp4?t=1750786116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Solo Play</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Leave your teammates behind in favour of a solo session, if you dare. Enter at your own risk, the horror only intensifies as you attempt to escape and survive alone.  <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/7d0fd197bd3427e2b7c54e87aad7bb5e.poster.avif?t=1750786116\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/7d0fd197bd3427e2b7c54e87aad7bb5e.webm?t=1750786116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/7d0fd197bd3427e2b7c54e87aad7bb5e.mp4?t=1750786116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Truly terrifying, Anxious and Diverse Environments</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a range of abandoned, decaying research facilities, each with its own unique theme, challenges and hazards. These environments are designed to build tension and challenge your survival instincts at every turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/4c9b34943c384f5babaa565dee9af308.poster.avif?t=1750786116\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/4c9b34943c384f5babaa565dee9af308.webm?t=1750786116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1200770/extras/4c9b34943c384f5babaa565dee9af308.mp4?t=1750786116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Original Soundtrack</strong><br>A haunting music score by BAFTA-nominated composer, David Housden (Thomas was Alone, Volume, Q.U.B.E. 2). </p>",
